    <div class="danger-callout">
      <strong>Important:</strong> Account deletion permanently removes your access to BizBoost AI, including your saved brand profiles, marketing content, and generation history.
    </div>

    <h2>Method 1: Direct In-App Deletion</h2>
    <p>
      If this feature is available in your current app version, you can delete your account directly inside the BizBoost AI Android application:
    </p>

    <div class="step-box">
      <h3>In-App Deletion Steps:</h3>
      <ol>
        <li>Open the <strong>BizBoost AI</strong> app on your Android device.</li>
        <li>Ensure you are signed in to the account you wish to delete.</li>
        <li>Open <strong>Settings</strong> (tap the gear icon from the dashboard).</li>
        <li>Scroll down to the bottom of the Settings screen.</li>
        <li>Tap <strong>"Delete My Account"</strong>.</li>
        <li>Review the confirmation dialog and confirm your request to delete the account.</li>
      </ol>
    </div>
    <p>
      Confirming this action signs you out and triggers the deletion of your account credentials and personal library items from our servers.
    </p>

    <h2>Method 2: Deletion Request by Email (If You Cannot Access the App)</h2>
    <p>
      If you have uninstalled the app, lost access to your mobile device, or are using a version without the in-app deletion button, you can request account deletion by contacting support:
    </p>

    <div class="step-box">
      <h3>Email Request Instructions:</h3>
      <ol>
        <li>Send an email to: <a href="mailto:[INSERT SUPPORT EMAIL]">[INSERT SUPPORT EMAIL]</a></li>
        <li>Use the Subject line: <strong>"BizBoost AI - Account Deletion Request"</strong></li>
        <li>Send the request from the <strong>same email address</strong> registered with your BizBoost AI account to verify account ownership.</li>
        <li>State clearly that you want your account and associated data permanently deleted.</li>
      </ol>
    </div>

    <h2>What Data Is Deleted?</h2>
    <p>Upon processing your deletion request, we delete your personal and account data, including:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Your login credentials (email address and authentication identifiers).</li>
      <li>Your profile information (display name, business role).</li>
      <li>Saved brand profiles and custom business descriptions.</li>
      <li>Saved marketing creations (posts, captions, ad copy, product descriptions, calendars).</li>
      <li>AI generation history records associated with your account.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Data Retention Exceptions</h2>
    <p>
      Associated personal data will be deleted, except for data that we are required or permitted to retain for legitimate legal, regulatory, security, tax, or fraud prevention obligations, or to resolve active disputes as permitted by applicable law.
    </p>

